    <briefdescription>
<para>Helpers for integrating the plastic flow rule in finite-strain plasticity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides exponential-map and first-order approximations for the incremental plastic deformation gradient together with their derivatives with respect to the plastic velocity gradient. </para>
